---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="section software-section" id="software-inventory">
  <div class="container software-grid">
    <div class="software-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">New in 0.1.3 · Software inventory</p>
      <h2>Know what’s installed.<br/>See what changed.</h2>
      <p>Find a package on one computer or compare versions across your estate. Keep the last complete snapshot in view while a fresh scan runs.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><Icon name="check" size={15}/>Scheduled collection on Windows and Linux</li>
        <li><Icon name="check" size={15}/>Software, installations, device coverage and changes</li>
        <li><Icon name="check" size={15}/>Package detail cards and filtered CSV exports</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="software-links">
        <a class="text-link" href="/docs/guides/software-inventory/">Explore software inventory <Icon name="arrow" size={15}/></a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/docs/reference/product-specification/">Read the product specification <Icon name="arrow" size={15}/></a>
      </div>
      <p class="software-note">Read-only package metadata. Software collection is not available on macOS.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="inventory-preview">
      <div class="preview-heading"><span><Icon name="layers" size={16}/>Software inventory</span><span class="snapshot-pill">Saved snapshot</span></div>
      <div class="preview-row"><div><strong>Example package</strong><span>2.4.1 · Example publisher</span></div><span class="source-pill">dpkg</span></div>
      <details open>
        <summary><span><Icon name="layers" size={15}/>Package details</span><Icon name="chevron" size={14}/></summary>
        <div class="preview-cards">
          <div><h3><Icon name="layers" size={14}/>Package identity</h3><dl><dt>Package ID</dt><dd>example-package</dd><dt>Version</dt><dd>2.4.1</dd></dl></div>
          <div><h3><Icon name="download" size={14}/>Installation</h3><dl><dt>Scope</dt><dd>Machine</dd><dt>Location</dt><dd>Not reported</dd></dl></div>
          <div><h3><Icon name="monitor" size={14}/>Client &amp; platform</h3><dl><dt>Client</dt><dd>example-host</dd><dt>Platform</dt><dd>Linux · x64</dd></dl></div>
          <div><h3><Icon name="clock" size={14}/>Collection &amp; freshness</h3><p>The last complete snapshot stays available during refresh.</p></div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <p class="preview-caption">Illustrative inventory · Example data · Open or close Package details</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .software-section { background: #0b111c; border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .software-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; align-items: center; gap: 64px; }
  .software-copy h2 { margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .software-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; }
  .software-copy ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 25px 0; display: grid; gap: 14px; }
  .software-copy li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; color: #b7cbe0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .software-copy li svg { color: var(--cyan); flex: none; margin-top: 2px; }
  .software-links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 18px; }
  .software-copy .software-note { font-size: 11px !important; margin: 22px 0 0; }
  .inventory-preview { min-width: 0; padding: 22px; background: #101925; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; }
  .preview-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; padding-bottom: 22px; font-size: 12px; }
  .preview-heading > span:first-child { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; }
  .preview-heading svg { color: var(--cyan); }
  .snapshot-pill, .source-pill { font: 9px var(--mono); border: 1px solid #5ae5ed30; border-radius: 20px; padding: 5px 8px; color: #90d4d8; }
  .preview-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; padding: 14px 2px 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .preview-row strong { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 550; }
  .preview-row div > span { display: block; margin-top: 7px; color: #8097b1; font-size: 10px; }
  details { background: #0a111b; border: 1px solid var(--line-bright); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
  summary { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; list-style: none; padding: 15px; font-size: 11px; cursor: pointer; }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  summary > span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; }
  summary svg { color: var(--cyan); }
  summary > svg { transform: rotate(90deg); transition: transform .15s ease; }
  details[open] summary { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  details[open] summary > svg { transform: rotate(-90deg); }
  summary:hover { background: #5ae5ed08; }
  summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--cyan); outline-offset: -3px; }
  .preview-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); padding: 12px; gap: 10px; }
  .preview-cards > div { min-width: 0; padding: 15px 12px; background: #121d2a; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; }
  .preview-cards h3 { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 550; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 13px; }
  .preview-cards h3 svg { color: var(--cyan); flex: none; }
  dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 10px 12px; font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }
  dt { color: #7f98b3; }
  dd { margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; color: #c2d0df; }
  .preview-cards p { color: #91a9c1; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0; }
  .preview-caption { font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 14px 0 0; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .software-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; } }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .inventory-preview { padding: 15px; } .preview-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { summary > svg { transition: none; } }
</style>
